Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.84,0:00:25.10,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我担心你 我想帮助你 我们心意相通
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.64,0:00:29.36,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,这还不足以作为一起战斗的理由吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.37,0:00:33.92,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我交到朋友了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.69,0:00:44.40,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,追赶被绑架的小空 我从自己的世界 掉落到了天窗市...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.97,0:00:45.82,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,错了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.01,0:00:50.99,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我威风凌凌亮相定场 遇见了一位姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.07,0:00:53.69,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,她叫虹丘真白
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.55,0:01:01.87,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同学使用天空幻镜 变身为了Cure Prism！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.90,0:01:06.39,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 现在是我们两个人来保护小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.59,0:01:15.38,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,她是我这个只顾着英雄锻炼的人 交到的第一位朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.80,0:01:18.72,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,朋友... 朋友...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.97,0:01:24.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(700,0)\c&H535354&\frz285.2\pos(1304,533)}{\3c&H000000&\3a&HFF&\4c&H000000&\4a&HFF&\c&H3D3C3F&\fn@Droid Sans Fallback}两个人是Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.14,0:01:22.43,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈 不知道为什么 一说这个词就让人心跳加速！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.96,0:01:38.12,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 差点忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.73,0:01:41.03,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,这样就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.21,0:01:46.68,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,早上好！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.89,0:01:48.44,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,早 小晴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.30,0:01:53.48,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同学 你怎么了？打扮成这样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.71,0:01:56.64,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,这是学校的制服！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.10,0:02:00.82,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,非常漂亮！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.09,0:02:02.88,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,今天就开学了...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.16,0:02:05.83,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,话说小晴 你知道学校吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.35,0:02:08.02,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,知道 当然知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.26,0:02:12.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝天大地也有学校 我也有上学的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.26,0:02:12.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(635,960)}Sky Land
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.26,0:02:17.46,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗 在这方面 那边跟这边世界是相同的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.63,0:02:18.58,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.76,0:02:22.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（开关门声）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.75,0:02:24.40,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我出门了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.91,0:02:28.92,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天的电视节目很有趣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.12,0:02:31.61,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚会播什么节目呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.80,0:02:33.02,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.87,0:02:39.75,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,前几天 我尝试了一下 倒立着能够走多少步...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.07,0:02:41.12,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}咦？（心声）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.73,0:02:47.06,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,对对 小空在睡觉的时候  偶尔是会说梦话的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.63,0:02:50.31,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,很可爱吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.47,0:02:51.80,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}诶诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.01,0:02:58.42,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,那什么... 小晴 送我到这里就可以了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.22,0:02:59.86,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.08,0:03:00.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎哟？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.05,0:03:03.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好 这里无关者禁止入内
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.86,0:03:09.60,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶 学校是谁都可以自由出入的场所 这是蓝天大地的常识...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.76,0:03:10.75,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.04,0:03:13.24,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不能说蓝天大地的事情！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.68,0:03:15.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.88,0:03:19.52,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 啊哈哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.12,0:04:58.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}吐露心声！小晴真情流露
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.96,0:05:01.45,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道不能进入的！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.00,0:05:03.16,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.70,0:05:05.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下次要多注意啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.55,0:05:08.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\3a&HFF&\4c&H000000&\4a&HFF&\fn@Droid Sans Fallback\frx16\fry352\frz273.9\pos(938.4,485.8)}{\fs50}私立天窗学院
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.95,0:05:07.87,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.58,0:05:11.04,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,那么小晴 放学见
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.27,0:05:14.09,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同学 上学要用功啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.34,0:05:15.41,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.18,0:05:23.72,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,既然如此！我就做好我分内的事情！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.69,0:05:25.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,让整间房子！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.30,0:05:28.71,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,都闪闪发光！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.63,0:05:31.95,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,对这家人收留了我们 略表恩义！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.71,0:05:34.07,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.53,0:05:35.90,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,抽空学习！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.49,0:05:37.87,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,照料小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.43,0:05:39.98,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,锻炼也不能忘！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.17,0:05:41.09,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.48,0:05:43.09,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,有好多能够做的事情！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.57,0:05:51.84,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,没有能够做的事情了...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.82,0:05:57.84,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,才11点半...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.80,0:06:01.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.82,0:06:10.31,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴 现在在做什么呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.20,0:06:15.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（敲门声）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.18,0:06:17.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请进
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.52,0:06:22.85,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,请问... 还有我能够帮上忙的事情吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.21,0:06:26.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有啊 你来得正好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.19,0:06:32.62,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,弄这个 还挺费力气的！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.80,0:06:34.10,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.08,0:06:37.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(1155,25.4)}{\fs50}棉花糖 2kg 砂铁 100g 小麦粉 1kg\N章鱼足尖 200g 草莓 300g 猫头鹰的羽毛\N黏土 600g 奶糖 2箱 纽扣电池 CR2032\N贝壳 1kg 樱花花瓣 5枚 笔记本 2册 葡萄汁\N柊树叶 1枚 琉璃瓶 2个 郁金香的花 雨滴\N生姜 2个 漂亮的珊瑚 2个 大蒜 3个\N铁质浇水壶 鱼的鳞片 5枚 树根 250g\N南瓜 1kg 芥菜的种子 1kg 毛茛 50g
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.55,0:06:38.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,距离完成通道 还有很多的步骤
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.68,0:06:40.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你帮大忙了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.76,0:06:42.65,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,能帮上忙就好！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.55,0:06:46.44,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,由由阿姨 一直都在做这么麻烦的事情吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.33,0:06:49.52,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.18,0:06:51.67,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,腻害！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.07,0:06:59.13,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,由由阿姨
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.38,0:07:05.94,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,上次真的很抱歉！我只顾自己的事情...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.75,0:07:11.97,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,对着由由阿姨发脾气...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.87,0:07:15.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都过去了 别在意
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.36,0:07:18.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在感觉怎么样？习惯这边世界的生活了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.23,0:07:22.98,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,习惯了 可是我处处都受到你们的照顾...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.44,0:07:26.22,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,一直都在给大家添麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.58,0:07:31.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有的事 小晴妹妹做任何事情都竭尽全力的态度
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.78,0:07:33.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是非常难能可贵的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.53,0:07:40.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然会遇到很多困难 这边的世界有很多吸引人的事物 没错吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.03,0:07:45.66,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 今天见到的真白同学的学校 也很有趣的样子！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.04,0:07:47.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也想上学吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.77,0:07:49.33,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶...不
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.50,0:07:52.33,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我在这个家里还有要做的事情...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.99,0:07:54.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.63,0:08:01.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.40,0:08:02.53,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.20,0:08:06.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能再麻烦你去买点东西吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.29,0:08:09.06,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 我去了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.64,0:08:10.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻烦你了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.75,0:08:11.96,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.65,0:08:14.68,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.88,0:08:16.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘘
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.45,0:08:18.67,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.89,0:08:25.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂喂 有点小事想要劳烦...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.35,0:08:31.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小白跟我们一起去吃饭吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.38,0:08:33.12,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.34,0:08:35.12,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴你也...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.45,0:08:36.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.24,0:08:37.99,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 嘻嘻...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.16,0:08:40.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\c&HA358FF&\3c&H000000&\3a&HFF&\4c&H000000&\4a&HFF&\pos(808.8,603.4)}唯美着迷
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.45,0:08:43.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an7}{\fs50}棉花糖 2kg\N章鱼足尖 200g\N猫头鹰的羽毛\N纽扣电池 CR2032\N笔记本 2册
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.70,0:08:43.36,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,这也是打开通道需要用到的？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.75,0:08:46.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后还是买了香粉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.75,0:08:46.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Powder Fragrance
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.42,0:08:48.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈哈 弄个香喷喷吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.93,0:08:54.04,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇... 好可爱！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.77,0:08:58.03,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同学应该很喜欢吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.27,0:09:02.28,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同学啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.81,0:09:07.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.32,0:09:08.66,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.31,0:09:12.39,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.59,0:09:13.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.36,0:09:15.60,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么在这里？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.83,0:09:17.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？刚放学哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.25,0:09:21.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你倒是怎么了？愁眉苦脸的？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.25,0:09:24.38,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 诶...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.65,0:09:27.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.73,0:09:32.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先把心情嗨起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.63,0:09:43.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有精神了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.92,0:09:44.71,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.92,0:09:48.69,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 可是...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.86,0:09:52.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看你的表情 烦恼还没有解决呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.46,0:09:56.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天怎么一个人？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.82,0:09:58.58,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 是这样的...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.77,0:10:00.88,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同学今天开始去上学了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.15,0:10:04.77,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我是按照由由阿姨的嘱托 来帮忙跑腿的...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.45,0:10:08.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.54,0:10:10.27,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,然后...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.29,0:10:16.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴是跟小白分开了 寂寞了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.94,0:10:20.20,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？是... 是这样的吗...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.43,0:10:26.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我懂的哦 小白的温柔 就像是太阳公公暖洋洋的光芒一样
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.86,0:10:29.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小白不在身边 一下子就会觉得好寂寞...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.10,0:10:30.98,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,没错！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.15,0:10:35.53,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我就纳闷今天怎么跟平时不一样了 原因就在于！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.79,0:10:39.37,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,今天没跟真白同学在一起！就是这样！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.90,0:10:44.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈！气势冲天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.98,0:10:47.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 你是不是搞错了对象啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.81,0:10:49.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去跟小白本人说吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.05,0:10:53.59,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,说不出口...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.84,0:10:57.51,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,要跟真白同学说 好难为情的...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.83,0:11:03.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴 再陪我一会儿吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.60,0:11:08.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好 能够试用一下商品吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.34,0:11:09.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以 请用
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.79,0:11:12.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢 你坐这里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.65,0:11:13.52,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.72,0:11:15.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用这个 还有这个！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.33,0:11:19.04,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶姐 我不怎么化妆...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.13,0:11:24.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要动
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.28,0:11:36.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,化妆不仅仅是让人打扮得漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.57,0:11:41.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在缺乏勇气的时候 会给予你力量的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.65,0:11:48.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,个人理解 啊哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.67,0:11:51.26,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.97,0:11:55.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后再来一点亮亮的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.75,0:11:57.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.26,0:12:02.45,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害... 一闪一闪的 而且...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.53,0:12:06.23,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好香啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.23,0:12:09.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,心情也闪亮了起来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.70,0:12:10.59,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.78,0:12:13.31,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,有种无所不能的感觉！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.43,0:12:16.77,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.96,0:12:22.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 小晴要把刚才的感情 好好地传达给小白哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.39,0:12:25.28,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是 我去了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.71,0:12:27.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一路顺风
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.98,0:12:34.08,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶姐 谢谢你了！我走了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.04,0:12:37.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（开关门声）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.79,0:12:40.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯... 青春啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.96,0:12:46.64,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,要告诉她！我的感情...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.75,0:13:01.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈 哈 哈 哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.14,0:13:04.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同学！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.55,0:13:07.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同学！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.01,0:13:11.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（铃声）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.72,0:13:23.72,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我来帮你！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.27,0:13:27.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.17,0:13:29.62,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小事一桩！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.76,0:13:36.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.04,0:13:39.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.52,0:13:40.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.13,0:13:42.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.56,0:13:43.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.87,0:13:45.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.53,0:13:50.22,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不能打架！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.68,0:13:51.53,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,再见！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.02,0:13:54.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不住！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.94,0:13:56.36,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,要赶快了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.15,0:14:00.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\c&H211C16&\3c&HF5F5F5&\4c&HF5F5F5&\frz4.762\pos(628.8,365.8)}禁止通行 不能进入哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.22,0:14:03.25,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 啊 啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.43,0:14:04.97,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,这次是道路封闭了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.79,0:14:10.02,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 道路封闭算得了什么啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.22,0:14:14.67,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.08,0:14:26.86,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！小晴？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.54,0:14:29.73,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同学！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.18,0:14:32.29,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了？你跑到这里来...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.09,0:14:43.27,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,有... 有件事一定要跟真白同学说...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.13,0:14:49.59,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我今天心里一直都很奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.28,0:14:53.48,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,终于明白是什么原因了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.03,0:14:56.40,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.65,0:15:01.37,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我想和真白同学一起...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.70,0:15:05.67,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,停！停下 停下！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.90,0:15:08.09,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是你！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.37,0:15:11.50,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你又出现了呢 卡疤痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.77,0:15:13.17,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,听好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.33,0:15:18.99,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我上次啊 因为关东煮是低卡路里 所以能量不够
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.18,0:15:20.94,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,才会以失败而告终...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.78,0:15:26.35,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我今天点了超高卡路里的外卖...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.65,0:15:27.94,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,再高也是浪费！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.21,0:15:31.74,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,应该说 你连1秒的戏份都没有！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.99,0:15:33.41,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,别来碍事！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.87,0:15:39.08,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,不爽啊！那就满足你们 这就开干！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.91,0:15:46.31,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,好吃！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.98,0:15:49.86,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧！暗塌谷能量！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.67,0:16:00.90,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.67,0:16:04.65,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,要变身了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.13,0:16:06.44,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
