Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.63,0:17:50.01,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,一上来就是两个Precure...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.22,0:17:53.08,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,给我把她们一网打尽 乱暴兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.28,0:17:55.98,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.96,0:18:07.80,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.26,0:18:13.83,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.49,0:18:17.71,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.18,0:18:22.34,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,被防住了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.78,0:18:24.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,招数不起效果吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.59,0:18:32.19,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,咳咳咳...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.04,0:18:33.95,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,它在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.34,0:18:41.08,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈哈！这下你们玩完了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.27,0:18:43.76,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我啊 强啊... 诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.32,0:18:47.84,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.34,0:18:50.01,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,就算被迷雾阻碍了...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.79,0:18:53.69,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,只要跨越过去 就能够解决麻烦！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.55,0:19:05.78,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,天空蓝！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.55,0:19:05.78,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Sky Blue！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.03,0:19:10.47,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,棱镜白！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.03,0:19:10.47,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Prism White！
