Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.04,0:19:44.85,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,都摄取了高卡路里 白费了啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.30,0:19:46.74,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,卡疤痛痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.80,0:20:07.65,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(520,1060)}那什么...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.80,0:20:07.65,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1400,1060)}那什么...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.76,0:20:11.42,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 真白同学 你先说
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.65,0:20:13.93,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不不 小晴先说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.00,0:20:17.34,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那我就...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.57,0:20:33.03,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同学... 我想
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.32,0:20:36.09,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我想和真白同学有更多的相处时间！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.66,0:20:44.06,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我今天也在思考同一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.50,0:20:45.73,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.03,0:20:50.55,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴不在身边 时间过得真的好慢啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.33,0:20:56.17,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是的！今天在家里 已经努力打扫和帮忙了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.35,0:21:01.53,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,满脑子都是 真白同学怎么还不快点回来...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.99,0:21:03.44,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶嘿嘿...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.26,0:21:15.31,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}小蝶姐 我说出来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.45,0:21:17.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿嚏！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.04,0:21:20.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁在议论我啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.68,0:21:23.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难不成...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.51,0:21:31.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴终于说出口了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.87,0:21:35.98,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？可以一起上学了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.25,0:21:38.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,手续已经办好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.85,0:21:42.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还要购买必要的文具之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.34,0:21:43.55,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空空！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.41,0:21:46.42,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真的可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.64,0:21:47.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.82,0:21:49.15,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空空！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.34,0:21:50.31,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.55,0:21:55.24,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！我超级期待跟真白同学一起上学！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.49,0:21:57.03,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.06,0:22:02.12,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好期待小晴穿校服啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.31,0:22:08.77,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是我 Cure Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.31,0:22:08.77,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1080,960)}天空愈卫
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.31,0:22:12.40,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,大家和我一起跳吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.15,0:23:48.95,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,转校第一天 从自我介绍开始
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.16,0:23:50.65,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,已经练习得很完美了！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.95,0:23:54.93,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,鄙人·晴雯丽 来着天上国度·蓝天大地...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.10,0:23:57.30,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！不能说蓝天大地的事情！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.45,0:23:59.81,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.45,0:23:59.81,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海阔天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.08,0:24:03.09,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,心跳不已！转校生是英雄少女!!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.26,0:03:22.47,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}（冲上蓝天！）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.47,0:03:28.06,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飞 超越云巅
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.27,0:03:33.61,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,飞吧！向着海阔天空的世界 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.61,0:03:41.33,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（晴空万里 美丽蓝天 翱翔吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.53,0:03:46.53,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,雨后初霁天空棱镜折射出彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.74,0:03:50.72,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝天的景色预告着有好事发生
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.72,0:03:52.21,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（蓝天的景色）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.21,0:03:56.51,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要确认一下 便伸直了双手
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.10,0:04:01.09,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了名为希望的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.18,0:04:03.05,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,秒速紧握！紧紧握住！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.18,0:04:07.64,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,战胜绝望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.03,0:04:11.61,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.61,0:04:14.98,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}擦干眼泪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.65,0:04:14.98,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}（你已经做好准备了吗）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.98,0:04:17.02,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}飞跃而起
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.40,0:04:17.02,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}(让我们张开勇气之翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.36,0:04:22.74,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飞 朝气蓬勃
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.95,0:04:27.41,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,把烦躁化为光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.66,0:04:32.71,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,未知的世界 未来的图景 充满着可能
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.88,0:04:37.46,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,与在同一片蓝天下的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.84,0:04:40.26,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,一起唤起通向明日的奇迹！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.38,0:04:48.27,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女 海阔天空！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.98,0:22:29.65,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了!! 晴空万里
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.65,0:22:34.24,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是能实现梦想与心愿的蔚蓝
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.41,0:22:36.99,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,打开心中的麦克风
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.99,0:22:38.83,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,轻轻哼唱起！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.83,0:22:41.21,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,希望的旋律♪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.67,0:22:44.13,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}今天心情愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.13,0:22:46.09,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}如果能与你分享
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.09,0:22:48.76,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,就能打开心灵+门扉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.84,0:22:51.55,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}稍等片刻！我已经激动到势不可挡!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.55,0:22:53.22,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}笑容也在合唱！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.35,0:22:55.89,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧☆我的好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.00,0:23:02.44,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}还是那条街 {\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}就像平日里
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.15,0:23:08.27,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都在那里 这便是奇迹啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.27,0:23:10.61,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的宝贝！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.32,0:23:14.99,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都过来！传开这韵律
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.99,0:23:19.23,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,手牵起手 心连起心
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.24,0:23:25.33,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,用温暖的关怀 培育出的勇气 是无穷无穷的∞
